          "stem": "Case A: A pharmacy checks and records its medication temperature only once per day, though the described Board policy calls for two reviews and records daily.\n\nCase B: After an excursion, the unit returns to normal temperature and staff release quarantined products without evaluating exposure duration or stability evidence.\n\nWhich conclusion correctly addresses Case B? Select ONE answer.",
